<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-MARSEILLE OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARSEILLE OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE, France 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $539,250 Marseille Open men's tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 5-Cedric Pioline (France)</p>
<p>6-1 6-7 (9-11) 6-1</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 7-Francisco Clavet (Spain) 2-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Andrei Chesnokov (Russia) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 4-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Lionel Roux (France) beat Andrei Olhovsky (Russia) 6-1 2-6 6-4</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Francisco Roig (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>4-6 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>4-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) beat Thierry Champion (France) 6-2 3-1 (Champion withdrew injured) 1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
</text>
